Jenkins might be listening only on localhost
Check listening ports:
sudo lsof -i :8080
If you see 127.0.0.1:8080, it means Jenkins is only bound to localhost.
➡ Fix: Edit Jenkins config:
sudo nano /etc/default/jenkins
Find the line: HTTP_HOST=127.0.0.1
Change it to: HTTP_HOST=0.0.0.0
sudo systemctl restart jenkins

